Guzzle HTTP Assistant is a PHP library for interacting with the Guzzle HTTP client. It provides a simple interface to the Guzzle HTTP client, allowing you to perform HTTP requests, parse responses, and manipulate data.

## Installation

You can install this extension through Composer, using the following command:

```bash
composer require michael-h-schroeder/guzzle-http-assistant
```

## Usage

Here's an example of how to use the library:

```php
use GuzzleHttp\Client;
use GuzzleHttp\Exception\RequestException;
use GuzzleHttp\Psr7\MultipartStream;
use GuzzleHttp\Psr7\Request;
use GuzzleHttp\Psr7\Response;

$client = new Client();

$request = $client->request('GET', 'http://example.com');
$response = $request->send();

$headers = $response->getHeaders();

$body = $response->getBody();
```

